<title>SWEDEN: Forsheda board recommends TI takeover bid.</title>
<headline>Forsheda board recommends TI takeover bid.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish polymer group Forsheda said on Monday its board recommended shareholders to accept a takeover bid from the British TI Group valued at 225 crowns per B-series share.  </p>
<p>&quot;Forsheda's board of directors recommends B-series shareholders to accept the offer,&quot; Forsheda said in a statement.</p>
<p>TI said earlier it bid 225 crowns per listed B-series share and 247.50 crowns per unlisted A-series share in an offer it said was worth a total of 189 million pounds for the Swedish group.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
